<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The high route proper begins above the last of the trees.<sup data-fn="a1b2c3d4" class="fn"><a href="#a1b2c3d4" id="a1b2c3d4-link">1</a></sup></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>For gear details, see <a href="https://example.com/gear-notes-route-flyover/" data-type="post" data-id="102">our gear notes post</a>.</p>
