    <item>
        <title>Pfiffner Traverse: Notes from 500 Miles</title>
        <link>https://example.com/pfiffner-traverse/</link>
        <pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[danny]]></dc:creator>
        <category domain="category" nicename="hiking"><![CDATA[Hiking]]></category>
        <category domain="category" nicename="trip-reports"><![CDATA[Trip Reports]]></category>
        <category domain="post_tag" nicename="colorado"><![CDATA[Colorado]]></category>
        <category domain="author" nicename="danny"><![CDATA[Danny]]></category>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/?p=105</guid>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The Pfiffner Traverse runs the spine of the Continental Divide through the Front Range.<sup data-fn="c0ffee01" class="fn"><a href="#c0ffee01" id="c0ffee01-link">1</a></sup></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Most of it is off-trail. Route-finding above treeline is the whole game.<sup data-fn="deadbeef" class="fn"><a href="#deadbeef" id="deadbeef-link">2</a></sup></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I bailed at Monarch Pass, same as the first attempt. Weather, mostly.<sup data-fn="00000000" class="fn"><a href="#00000000" id="00000000-link">3</a></sup></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">What I would change</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list">
<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Start two weeks later.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->
<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Carry an ice axe through the first section.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->
]]></content:encoded>
        <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[<hr>
<h5 class="page-description"><i>
Five hundred miles, two bail-outs, one ice axe I should have brought
</i></h5>
<p>
Notes from two attempts at Andrew Skurka's Pfiffner Traverse.
</p>]]></excerpt:encoded>
