    <item>
        <title>DIY Electrolyte Mix</title>
        <link>https://example.com/diy-electrolyte-mix/</link>
        <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 17:45:00 +0000</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[siyang]]></dc:creator>
        <category domain="category" nicename="gear"><![CDATA[Gear]]></category>
        <category domain="post_tag" nicename="nutrition"><![CDATA[Nutrition]]></category>
        <category domain="author" nicename="siyang"><![CDATA[Siyang]]></category>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/?p=106</guid>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Commercial mixes are mostly sugar and markup. This is what I make instead.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:table -->
<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Ingredient</th><th>Amount</th><th>Provides</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Table salt</td><td>1/4 tsp</td><td>~590 mg sodium</td></tr><tr><td>Lite salt</td><td>1/4 tsp</td><td>~350 mg potassium</td></tr><tr><td>Sugar</td><td>2 tbsp</td><td>Carbs, aids absorption</td></tr><tr><td>Lemon juice</td><td>1 tbsp</td><td>Flavor</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Per 1 liter of water.</figcaption></figure>
<!-- /wp:table -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Mix it the night before. It tastes better cold. If you want to know more about who's behind this site, see <a href="https://example.com/about/" data-type="page" data-id="5">our About page</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:table {"hasFixedLayout":true,"className":"is-style-stripes"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-table is-style-stripes"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td>No header row</td><td>on this one</td></tr><tr><td>Just</td><td>body cells</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
<!-- /wp:table -->
]]></content:encoded>
        <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[<p>
Four ingredients, about eleven cents a liter.
</p>]]></excerpt:encoded>
